## Glossary
SEC = specific energy consumption (kWh per unit output). IPMVP Option C = whole-facility M&V from the main meter. MRV = monitoring, reporting, verification. ADEETIE = BEE's MSME interest-subvention scheme (≥10% sustained savings). DISCOM = electricity distribution company. HT/LT = high/low-tension tariff. kVAh billing = energy billed on apparent energy. ToD = time-of-day tariff.
Careful: "CEA" means both the Central Electricity Authority (grid emission factor) and a BEE Certified Energy Auditor. In code use `grid_factor` and `auditor`, never `cea`.
